PHASE 2: Start Screen Recording

Once all four tabs are ready:

1. Press Windows + Alt + R on your keyboard at the same time.
2. A small recording indicator should appear on your screen.
3. Confirm that the recording has started before beginning your presentation.

Note: This shortcut works when recording is supported and enabled through Xbox Game Bar. If it does not work, open Xbox Game Bar using Windows + G and check the recording controls.
